# What must never reach the build context.
#
# The Dockerfile ends in `COPY . .`, and on the Hetzner host the build context
# is /root/mojo-dog-grooming — the same directory the compose file bind-mounts
# ./private-media and ./media out of. Without this file every image layer
# carries the scanned intake forms: client name, address, postcode, phone,
# emergency contact, vet and signature.
#
# That is the exact disclosure PRIVATE_MEDIA_ROOT (a sibling of MEDIA_ROOT, so
# Caddy's file_server can never reach it), the gated download view, and the
# random upload_to token all exist to prevent. An image is copied, pushed and
# cached far more casually than a directory on a server.

# ── Client data. The reason this file exists. ──────────────────────────
private-media/
media/

# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Local state that must not become image state ───────────────────────
# db.sqlite3 is the dev database; production is Postgres and baking a stale
# SQLite in would be both a data leak and a confusing one to debug.
db.sqlite3
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
# collectstatic regenerates this inside the image (Dockerfile), so a local
# copy would only shadow it with whatever was last built here.
staticfiles/

# ── Version control and CI ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/

# ── Flutter build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT the whole of mobile/. api.views.load_silhouette_svg reads
# mobile/assets/dog_silhouette.svg **at runtime**, off disk in the running
# container, so the web intake form and the app can never drift onto
# different-shaped dogs. Excluding mobile/ wholesale fails silently: the
# loader catches OSError and returns '', so the intake page would render with
# no dog on it and nothing in the log.
#
# Listed as individual subdirectories rather than `mobile/` plus a `!` negation
# for that reason — there is no re-inclusion here to get subtly wrong.
mobile/build/
mobile/.dart_tool/
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/
mobile/test/

# ── Docs and editor noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/
*.md
!README.md
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
